oh, thank you for your appeal!\nI looked at your other works and really enjoy them; these four in particular really stood out to me:\nhttps://www.foriio.com/works/707515\nhttps://www.foriio.com/works/972326\nhttps://x.com/oekakissaerizoh/status/1746699016442949765\nhttps://x.com/oekakissaerizoh/status/1717454067973423478\n\n◆ Outfit\nYou can change her outfits as you like or pick a new one from the Outfits folder.\n\n◆ Important Details\n- Grey skin\n- White hair\n- Black sclera\n- White eyes\n- Black tongue\n- Tongue piercing\n- Fangs\n- Black fingernails\n- Horn accessories\n- Ear piercings\n\n◆ Composition\nUp to you!\n\n◆ Themes\n- Tattered black bandages\n- Mirrors\nThere are additional themes in the Aesthetic folder if you'd like to take a look.\n\n◆ Background\nUp to you!\n\n◆ Other Information\nShe has the personality of an older sister who is possessive and protective, but can also come off as scary or creepy. She is also sometimes aggressive.\nUses shadow and space magic.\nShe can manipulate her shadow.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1aVHv77uRk29nlAetpUB2gYQT85z6_WhL", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@oekakissaerizoh/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2498312, "client_id": 2505379, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d4feed36/uploads/origins/e1e464f2-19cf-4753-a809-8ee7e9e1d826?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf14bbfbb00757be7d53c9be02f68134", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d4feed36/uploads/origins/e1e464f2-19cf-4753-a809-8ee7e9e1d826?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf14bbfbb00757be7d53c9be02f68134, https://si.imgix.net/d4feed36/uploads/origins/e1e464f2-19cf-4753-a809-8ee7e9e1d826?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27b32bf90bed6429b0c3dd587c780